 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Bond Management – Group Ledger IFRS (3WZ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio79d5cf6ad52749feb344b6f3b1123b4e\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio79d5cf6ad52749feb344b6f3b1123b4e__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">By activating parallel valuation for bond management – group ledger , you can use an additional valuation area besides your operative valuation area to reflect financial positions, investment, and financing results in accordance with International Financial Reporting Standards (9) phase I (Classification and Measurement).</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio79d5cf6ad52749feb344b6f3b1123b4e__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Post to parallel ledger of IFRS for transactions</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform key date valuation for security account class position</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reclassify from long term to short term</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio79d5cf6ad52749feb344b6f3b1123b4e__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Generate all postings for the general ledger</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Update the general ledger according to IFRS 9 phase I (Classification and Measurement)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Process the valuation of position</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Automate the month-end accounting processing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase your focus on value-added activities instead of on manual procedures</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>债券管理 – 集团分类账 IFRS (3WZ)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio79d5cf6ad52749feb344b6f3b1123b4e\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio79d5cf6ad52749feb344b6f3b1123b4e__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过激活债券管理 - 集团分类账的并行评估，您可以使用除运营评估范围以外的附加评估范围，根据国际财务报告标准 (9) 阶段 I（分类和度量）反映金融头寸、投资和融资结果。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio79d5cf6ad52749feb344b6f3b1123b4e__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">针对交易过账到 IFRS 的并行分类账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行证券账户类头寸的关键日期评估</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">从长期到短期重新分类</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio79d5cf6ad52749feb344b6f3b1123b4e__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">生成总账的所有过账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据 IFRS 9 阶段 I（分类和度量）更新总账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">处理头寸评估</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">自动化月末会计处理</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">增加您对增值活动的关注，而不是手动程序</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
